            <ArticleTitle>Results of Micro stent implantations in coronary lesions of various complexity.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>1601-2</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Micro stents appear to be especially suitable for the safe treatment of complex coronary lesions and adverse vessel morphology. Stenting of lesions with type C morphology is associated with a higher restenosis rate than stenting of less complex coronary obstructions.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
